  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **Third Number = (First Number + Second Number) × 4**\n\n**(13, 14, 108):**\n\n→ 108 = (13 + 14) × 4\n\n→ 108 = 27 × 4 \n\n→ 108 = 108\n\n**(51, 12, 252):**\n\n→ 252 = (51 + 12) × 4\n\n→ 252 = 63 × 4\n\n→ 252 = 252\n\nLet's check each option as per the logic,\n\n**1) (17, 14, 134):**\n\n→ 134 = (17 + 14) × 4\n\n→ 134 ≠ 124 \n\n→** LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**2) (29, 14, 172):**\n\n→ 172 = (29 + 14) × 4\n\n→ 172 = 172\n\n→ **LHS = RHS.**\n\n**3) (19, 26, 160):**\n\n→ 160 = (19 + 26) × 4\n\n→ 160 ≠ 180 \n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**4) (33, 42, 280):**\n\n→ 280 = (33 + 42) × 4\n\n→ 280 ≠ 300\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\nHere, we can see that only option 2 follow the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\" ****(29, 14, 172) \"**.",
